    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Analogous expressions follow for the three other additive effects $(\\alpha_{j}, \\alpha_{k}$, and $\\alpha_{l})$. Within each locus, the mean value of the average effects (weighted by the allele frequencies) is equal to zero.",
      "source_page": 101,
      "printed_page": 81,
