    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The dominance effects are defined by considering $ G_{ij...} $, the conditional mean phenotype of individuals with alleles i and j at the first locus without regard to genotypic state at the second locus. From Equation 4.26, it follows that",
