    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The definition of epistatic effects proceeds in a similar fashion. Letting $ G_{i,k} $ be the mean phenotype of individuals with gene i at locus 1 and k at locus 2, without regard to the other two genes, the ikth additive × additive effect is",
      "source_page": 101,
      "printed_page": 81,
